    //ship:geoposition:terrainheight gives height of terrain above sea-level at the ship's current position.
    //ship:altitude gives height of the ship above sea level.
    
    //Things we need to know: Current altitude, current relative surface velocity, delta v required to safely land, how long the burn will be to scrub off excess speed.
